<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`CONTENT_TYPE_FORM: number = 7`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer CONTENT_TYPE_FORM = 7;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CONTENT_TYPE_FORM has the value 7</p>
  <p>Sets the [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&amp;#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_media_type" target="_blank">Internet media type</a> `&quot;Content-Type&quot;` header of any subsequent <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LSL_HTTP_server" target="_blank">LSL HTTP server</a> response via <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlHTTPResponse" target="_blank">llHTTPResponse</a> to `&quot;application/x-www-form-urlencoded&quot;`.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>HTTPContentType</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
